# Defend the Rider, second mode: the Pilot token "crews Vehicles as though its power were 2 greater", so its 1 power
# counts as 3 (CR 702.122). Turn 1: with only Mother of Runes (power 1) the Crew 3 Reckoner Bankbuster cannot be crewed
# (the refusal); Defend the Rider makes a Pilot. Turn 3: the Pilot alone crews it, and the 4/4 Vehicle attacks Bot2 for 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Reckoner Bankbuster
Mother of Runes
Defend the Rider
Forest
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Reckoner Bankbuster.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mother of Runes.Cast
! Bot1.Battlefield.Reckoner Bankbuster.Activate(Ability: Crew 3)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Defend the Rider.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Create a 1/1 colorless Pilot creature token with "This token saddles Mounts and crews Vehicles as though its power were 2 greater.")
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Reckoner Bankbuster.Activate(Ability: Crew 3)
Bot1.Choose(Pilot Token)
Bot1.Attack(Reckoner Bankbuster > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Battlefield.Pilot Token.Tapped = True
Bot1.Battlefield.Mother of Runes.Tapped = False
